# Design-review dumps — extract + edit somewhere else, not at the repo root.
# (Guards against the 2026-08-19 mishap where `git add -A` swept a ChatGPT concept pack
# + accompanying zips + svg production folder onto main. Legit design assets live under
# docs/design/ or a per-release fastlane/ path, not the repo root.)
/tryst_*_icon_*/
/tryst_svg_*_set/
/tryst_*.zip
/ChatGPT Image *.png

